On 6 Apr 2003, Timo Sirainen wrote:

> On Sat, 2003-04-05 at 10:15, Kimura Fuyuki wrote:
> > I noticed an annoying behavior of dovecot: the message order (sequence
> > numbering) is reversed on COPYing in the maildir.
