I use procmail to create the directory on delivery of first item of mail

DROPPRIVS=3Dyes
MAILDIR=3D$HOME/Mail
DEFAULT=3D$MAILDIR/./

DUMMY=3D`if [ ! -d $MAILDIR ]; then mkdir $MAILDIR; fi`

--Andrew

