1. Simply provide default settings for any subgroups without doing
anything themselves:

group imap {
  protocols = imap
  # some IMAP defaults for a/b
  server a { ... }
  server b { ... }
}

group pop3 {
  protocols = pop3
  # different POP3 defaults for a/b
