On 27.5.2004, at 18:26, Olivier Tharan wrote:

> * Timo Sirainen <tss@iki.fi> (20040527 17:52):
>>> | May 27 16:04:38 munster imap(xxxx): Our dotlock file
>>> /home/xxxx/Mail/mrtg.lock was modified (1085666677 vs 1085666678),
